  "about": {
    "title": "About the Forbidden Light set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Forbidden Light is a Sun & Moon expansion released on 4 May 2018. It has 146 cards: 131 in the main set and 15 secret rares. There are also 105 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 131 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (236 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 251 cards, adding the 15 secret rares).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
